Name: Please record any issues that need to be addressed whether related to equipment, reporting, or house keeping and submit a Support Request for any outstanding issues.  (You must enter something in this box to complete the maintenance) | Type: Text Form Item | Value: The only issue I have is the lack of care for the equipment here at MSI there is no way the lens inside the headset should not be this dirty. It was trash everywhere, spider webs and other things that could be tended to during down time or before we open. We have everything we need to get the job done but the staff is not utilizing what we have in place to prevent dust and trash build up. I’m disappointed but I will come back and do a check up when I return from vacation.;

