Name: Please record any issues that need to be addressed whether related to equipment, reporting, or house keeping and submit a Support Request for any outstanding issues.  (You must enter something in this box to complete the maintenance) | Type: Text Form Item | Value: We are seeing on going issues with esp not starting up correctly. The screen will be enlarged and prevents the ride from starting. We have found that the resolutions are not saving. We have had to change the settings or we have to change them to the incorrect settings and then back to the correct one. Most recently, we found that the audio output changed to a DVI , adjusting this back to the correct one fixed the issue. What is odd is that this is not happening every morning. ;

