Name: Clean all excess grease that may have fallen from ball joints. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Check that jam nuts on all rams are tight against the clevis. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Perform a visual inspection of all bench welds securing the benches to the floor for security and integrity. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
