Name: Run machine and observe gearmotors and bearing for chatter, excess movement, looseness, or unusual sounds. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: "Inspect and test the functionality of all safety switches on the exterior of the machine.  (*Handrail Closed Limit  *Handrail Open Limit  )" | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Remove skirt (as needed) to allow access to motion base for maintenance and cleaning. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Using manual controls move machine to the "lower all" position so that all 3 motors are in the "6 O'clock" position. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Be sure to ""Lock Out"" the Machine When working on mechanical components. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Check tightness of platform and motion base bolts | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check electrical loom wear pad for position and wear. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check gearmotor assemblies for wear and bolt tightness | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check gearmotor brakes for chatter and wear(adjust if needed-authorized personnel only) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check universal joint and main center column | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check motion base and gearmotors for leaks. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: One pump from the grease gun to the  following grease fittings: (4)-pillow blocks, (2)-Universal Joint, (1) -center column, (3)-gearmotors (if applicable), (1)-Yaw Restrictor Bearing(use brush), (6)- Tie Rod End Bearings, (4)-Handrail Pivot Shaft, (1)- handrail manual release shaft into actuator bore (use brush) | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: With a rag remove the excess grease from all bearings and greasing points. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Clean skirt as needed | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Check operation and security of Main Disconnect switch | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Thoroughly vacuum all components on the entire machine including all fans on main electrical panel, control rack, effects fans etc.to remove dust and debris. Wipe down if needed. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Inspect control rack wiring to make sure all connections are secure and that all wiring is neatly routed. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Inspect all control rack components to be sure that everything is secure and all screws are in place. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check encoder and limit switch cables for wear/damage, security and connection. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Ensure all cables/wires are clear of moving parts and foot traffic. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect platform wiring for loose and frayed wires. Make sure all wiring & harnesses are secure. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check headset cradles and tethers for security, tension and wear | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect the condition of the platform for poor housekeeping and damage/wear. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect the platform for any sharp surfaces that could injure patrons. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Vacuum and wipe down platform as needed. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Re-install Skirt | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Test Run Machine | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Check and test the functionality of all E-Stop buttons. (*Operator  *Passenger) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
