Name: Please record any issues that need to be addressed whether related to equipment, reporting, or house keeping and submit a Support Request for any outstanding issues.  (You must enter something in this box to complete the maintenance) | Type: Text Form Item | Value: Very dirty. Poor house keeping. We had an inspection and she noted that the post side hand rail had a broken off bolt and stripped out bolts. Upon further inspection it looked like the floor was removed and reinstalled poorly causing damage to the floor as wel as damage tryin to reinstall the hand rail. We removed the handrail, retapped the holes and replaced the hardware. We also straightened out the bent flooring on the edge.  Flooring hardware was also retapped and refastened. They told us they removed the floor to find out where a noise was coming from. It ended up being the center shaft having a bit of noise. ;
