Name: Check tightness of platform and motion base bolts. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect rod ends and bushings for visible signs of wear (i.e., metal shavings, etc.). | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually / audibly inspect all fittings and hoses for air leaks. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Wipe down and dust all motion base components to remove dust and debris.  | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Grease all fittings on all motion base bearings. Wipe excess grease from fittings. (1 at U- joint cross, 1 at U-joint spline, 4 at yaw restrictor center joint, 1 at yaw restrictor heim joint, 3 upper cylinder rod ends and 3 lower cylinder pivots) | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Visually inspect all wiring under motion base for damage and secure connections. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Raise and secure the skirt in place.  | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Replace VR PC covers.  | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Visually inspect seat belts for wear and security. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check headset cradles and tethers for security, tension and wear.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect the platform for any sharp surfaces that could injure patrons.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect seating area wiring for loose and frayed wires. Make sure all wiring & harnesses are secure.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect the condition of the platform and enclosure (if applicable) for poor housekeeping and damage/wear. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Ensure all cables / wires are clear of moving parts and foot traffic.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Inspect control rack wiring to make sure that all connections are secure and that all wiring is neatly routed.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Inspect control rack components making sure all items are secure and screws are in place.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Remove and dust/blow out filters on control PC fan (if equipped).  | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Check and test the functionality of all ESTOP buttons.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Test run machine and record any issues that need to be addressed here.  (you must enter something here, enter "tested" if the machine works and there is nothing note worthy) | Type: Text Form Item | Value: tested;
