Name:  Perform pre-operational checks and start a normal ride cycle.   Approximately half way through the ride cycle turn the main  power off to simulate a power failure. | Type: Task | Value: ;
Name: The capsule should slowly return to the rest or home position.  | Type: Task | Value: ;
Name:  Once the simulator has returned to the rest position test  the emergency valves on the air locker to open the door.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: ;
Name:  Close the door, turn on electrical power and start up the system as per normal operating procedure. | Type: Task | Value: ;
Name:  Lubricate door cylinder pivot points with a general purpose lubricating oil. | Type: Task | Value: ;
Name: If any issues were noted please create a support REQUEST in UpKeep regarding this issue. | Type: Task | Value: ;
