Name: Please record any issues that need to be addressed whether related to equipment, reporting, or house keeping and submit a Support Request for any outstanding issues.  (You must enter something in this box to complete the maintenance) | Type: Text Form Item | Value: We have been experiencing issues with Client 4 turning on and off randomly during operation. The PC and headset cable have been changed recently, so I completed room set-up tonight and will be monitoring that Client closely. When performing the test run, the light on the side of the headset for Client 3 turned red leading me to believe that the cable needed to be replaced; however, an error message popped up that said " Displayport connection is not stable." (Image Attached) After some brief troubleshooting, the light on the side of the headset turned green and the headset became operational. I will also be monitoring this Client to see if we experience any additional issues. Cosmo Coaster has been glitching frequently. I followed Hugo Benjamin's advice and ran a defragment and optimized all 4 PCs. Also, the leather seats have been flaking very badly and pieces of the leather can be found all around the machine (Image Attached). ;

