Name: Please record any issues that need to be addressed whether related to equipment, reporting, or house keeping and submit a Support Request for any outstanding issues.  (You must enter something in this box to complete the maintenance) | Type: Text Form Item | Value: We have been experiencing issues with the PCs more frequently since switching the ride we offer to Cosmos Coaster. We have noticed that all four PCs will randomly shut down during operation or will sometimes glitch and show the rider underneath the VR machine. We are currently monitoring PC 2 as we have experienced the most issues with that client. When we boot on the VR machine, the PC will not automatically turn on like the other ones and the operators have to manually turn on that PC. This client will frequently shot down during operation and we have already troubleshooted by replacing the cable and headset to see if that would resolve the issue; however, we are still experiencing this issue. ;

