Name: Review Weekly 4DX Maintenance Checklists. (Attach pictures of weekly sheets to this item using the attachment or camera button to the right) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Be sure to "Lock Out" the Machine When working on mechanical components of machine. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Open VR PC covers and remove Access grills to access outside of VR PCs | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Vacuum outside of VR PC's (video card fans, CPU fans, external fans | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Unlock and fold down VR PC Rack to access inside of VR PC rack | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Vacuum inside of PC Rack (rear pc fans, external fans) all surrounding wiring as needed. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Lower skirt to allow access to motion base for maintenance and cleaning. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Check tightness of platform and motion base bolts | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect rod ends and bushings for visible signs of wear (i.e. metal shavings, etc) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect gearmotors for leaks and signs of wear (i.e. metal shavings) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Wipe down, dust and vacuum as needed all motion base components to remove all dust and debris. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Re install skirt. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Fold VR Rack back up right, lock in position, and replace Access grill covers. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: (If model is equipped with fittings) With a grease gun apply grease to (4) grease fittings between seats (2 between seats 1 &2, 2 between 3&4). Fittings are located under rubber mats. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect grab rails for signs of wear and security. Ensure all fasteners are tight | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Check headset cradles and tethers for security, tension and wear. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Visually inspect the platform for any sharp surfaces that could injure patrons. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Visually inspect seating area wiring for loose and frayed wires. Make sure all wiring & harnesses are secure. | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Visually inspect the condition of the platform and enclosure (if applicable) for poor housekeeping and damage/wear. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Ensure all cables/wires are clear of moving parts and foot traffic. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Vacuum all effects fans and lighting (if applicable) | Type: Task | Value: Complete;
Name: Inspect security of main electrical panel disconnect (in some models this may be located with in control rack) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Inspect control rack wiring to make sure all connections are secure and that all wiring is neatly routed. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
Name: Inspect control rack components making sure all items are secure and screws are inplace | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: Pass;
