Name: Download the file either directly on the ESP (with internet connection) or download to a separate computer and copy to USB to physically transfer the file to the ESP computer. | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Copying and transferring should be done with pulselock unlocked and the control program closed.  You can copy the zip file to the desktop of the control pc.   | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Open the zip file and you'll see a folder called MoonsOfSaturn for XXX.   | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Grab and drag that folder out to the desktop.  It will prompt you for a password to unzip the files.   | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Once its finished extracting you can now open the newly created folder and you'll see 2 files both named MoonsOfSaturn  1 will be an mp4 (video file) and the other will be a mtn (motionfile).  | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Right click-> cut the video file  | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Navigate to c:\ESP Control\videos\ folder and right click->paste to move the video file. | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Back on the desktop MoonsOfSaturn folder. With the .mtn file also right click-> cut the file from the folder on the desktop. | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Navigate to c:\ESP Control\motion\ folder.  Right click->paste to move the motion file. | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;
Name: Once both files have been moved to their location you can reboot your machine and when the control program starts back up you should now see the new ride listed in your ride list.   | Type: CHECKBOX | Value: CHECKED;

