Name: Check to ensure that the roll brake is functioning properly, adjust if required. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Check for excessive backlash (play) between the roll gearbox and roll brake transition. (separate if necessary) | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Test roll brake manual release mechanism for proper functionality. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Inspect and test the functionality of the "Roll Arrestor" assembly. Check to ensure all fasteners are tight. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Check oil level in the pitch gearbox and inspect pitch linkage assembly. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: "One pump from the grease gun to the  following grease fittings.   (2) - roll pillow blocks              (2) - pitch pillow blocks       (2) - fittings at pitch linkage assembly (if applicable)   | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: With a rag remove the excess grease from all bearings and greasing points. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Thoroughly vacuum all electronic components on the entire machine including drives, braking resistors, wiring harnesses, etc.  Vacuum machine base and cradle frames during this step also. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Inspect control rack wiring to make sure all connections are secure and that all wiring is neatly routed. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Inspect all control rack components to be sure that everything is secure and all screws are in place. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Visually inspect capsule wiring for loose and frayed wires. Make sure all wiring & harnesses are secure. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Visually inspect seatbelts for signs of wear or malfunction. Ensure all fasteners are tight | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Thoroughly vacuum the rear of the capsule being sure to remove dust from amp, power supply, capsule wiring harnesses and fans. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Visually inspect the condition of the capsule interior for poor housekeeping and damaged upholstery. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Check security of armrests and joysticks.  Inspect for any sharp or protruding screws. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Visually inspect the capsule interior for any sharp surfaces that could injure patrons. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Test functionality of foot chock mechanism.  Ensure all hardware is tight. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
