Name: Perform a visual inspection of simulator capsule mount bolts for  security.         | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Perform a visual inspection of motion base hold down bolts/nuts for security.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Perform a visual inspection of each hydraulic ram during operation  checking for loose hardware, leaks or abnormal movements. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
