Name: Additional comments can be added here. | Type: Text Form Item | Value: undefined;

Name: Ensure the weekly checklist is not past due, if so complete that first. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Grease the 12 upper and 8 lower grease fittings. Apply a general purpose grease 1 pump per fitting. Wipe off excess grease after competed. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Run a complete test ride to make sure system functions properly. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name: Disconnect electrical power to the air compressor. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Check the compressor drive belts for tension. The belts should not move up and down while the compressor runs and when stopped should not have more than ½ inch of play when depressed. Be careful not to over tighten the belts during adjustment. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name:  Remove and inspect air compressor filters. Clean or replace filters as needed. | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name:  Perform pre-operational checks and start a normal ride cycle.   Approximately half way through the ride cycle turn the main  power off to simulate a power failure. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: The capsule should slowly return to the rest or home position.  | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name:  Once the simulator has returned to the rest position test  the emergency valves on the air locker to open the door.  | Type: Checklist Form Item | Value: undefined;
Name:  Close the door, turn on electrical power and start up the system as per normal operating procedure. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name:  Lubricate door cylinder pivot points with a general purpose lubricating oil. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: If any issues were noted please create a support REQUEST in UpKeep regarding this issue. | Type: Task | Value: undefined;
Name: Additional comments can be noted here. | Type: Text Form Item | Value: undefined;

